@deliveryNoteIdSinFirmar = 6a45256e7018d49ba827e12b

### Crear albarán de materiales
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "client": "{{clientId}}",
  "project": "{{projectId}}",
  "format": "material",
  "description": "Entrega de cemento",
  "workDate": "2026-01-10",
  "material": "Cemento",
  "quantity": 10,
  "unit": "sacos"
}

### Crear albarán de horas con varios trabajadores
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "client": "{{clientId}}",
  "project": "{{projectId}}",
  "format": "hours",
  "description": "Instalación eléctrica planta baja",
  "workDate": "2026-01-15",
  "hours": 16,
  "workers": [
    { "name": "Juan Pérez", "hours": 8 },
    { "name": "Ana López", "hours": 8 }
  ]
}

### Listar albaranes
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Listar albaranes filtrados por proyecto, formato y rango de fechas
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote?project={{projectId}}&format=hours&signed=false&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31&sort=-workDate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Obtener un albarán concreto
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Descargar el PDF del albarán
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/pdf/{{deliveryNoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Firmar el albarán (multipart/form-data con imagen)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=BOUNDARY123

--BOUNDARY123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="signature"; filename="firma.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./firma-ejemplo.png
--BOUNDARY123--

### Intentar firmar sin imagen (debe dar 400)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}/sign
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Intentar borrar un albarán firmado (debe dar 400)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Borrar un albarán no firmado
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/{{deliveryNoteIdSinFirmar}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Listar albaranes archivados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/deliverynote/archived
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}